= Viktor Chernov to resign!

Viktor Chernov, the leader of the Socialist-Revolutionaries, has announced his intent to resign by the end of the year, citing his age, the failed Liberal-Narodist Coalition, and internal pressure.

We should lobby for a pro-Menshevik candidate if possible. A Menshevik-friendly PSR could go a long way towards our participation in future governments.

- @lobby
- @lobbybig
- @root: Whether out of disinterest or a lack of funding, we won't lobby for the Esers at this time.

@lobby
title: Provide minor funding to Eser moderates.
subtitle: Supporting candidates like Avksentyev will help turn the Esers leftwards, even if just a little.
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources
